                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "TL;DR Game is not developed anymore and is far from finished.\n\nThe short time I took to check the current state of the game was enough to decide it does not have enough content and is too buggy to get into right now. Sadly I missed the 14 days refund window.\n\nI was looking forward to this title but just as many other Early Access games the development has stopped way before the game could be described as finished.\n\nThis title had two updates in April and one in May. Since then, the author fell silent in the forums and his online presence ceased to exist. Nothing happened for over 4 months.\n\nSince this game is not finished and is lacking in both mechanics and content I can't write a positive review. In fact I won't be getting into repetitive gameplay or the great soundtrack - I could write a proper review once I know the game is being worked on. The fact that is not completely disqualifies it for me and I leave this as a warning sign for anyone else.",
